MuQ and MuQ-MuLan
-----------------

Meric uses MuQ-MuLan as its 512-dimensional music semantic anchor.
The upstream MuQ source code is MIT licensed, while the published MuQ and
MuQ-MuLan model weights are licensed under CC BY-NC 4.0.
The released mericldm.ckpt currently serializes the frozen MuQ-MuLan
parameters under the historical clap.* checkpoint namespace, in addition to
initializing the same model from the pinned upstream snapshot at runtime.
Those serialized parameters retain the CC BY-NC 4.0 terms.

The current Stage 2 checkpoint therefore contains materials governed by both
the Stability AI Community License and CC BY-NC 4.0.
Review both licenses before redistributing the checkpoint or using it
commercially.

Repository and weight license:
https://github.com/tencent-ailab/MuQ
https://github.com/tencent-ailab/MuQ/blob/main/LICENSE_weights

